-------------------------------

o As pointed by Oliver Clay and Lionel Guy on the seqinr diffusion
   list on 19-FEB-2010 there was a bug in getSequence.list()
   function that confused write.fasta() when all sequences were
   of the same length (a similar bug was reported by Yann Lesecque
